1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,473
A shorthand we will need constantly.

2
00:00:02,473 --> 00:00:08,020
n factorial is the product of all whole numbers from n down to one.

3
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:13,111
Five factorial is one hundred and twenty, six factorial seven hundred and twenty.

4
00:00:13,111 --> 00:00:18,971
And notice: n factorial equals n times n minus one factorial.

